NimbyGreet (Greet) - original work by Jeff Fabish for NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp.
Will modify the vanilla DayZ 1.30 MissionServer, MissionBase, MissionGameplay, PlayerBase, and
InGameMenu classes (Bohemia Interactive) to fetch and show the server welcome text; no
third-party mod code. Media shipped under Media/ is listed here with its source and license at
each release (plan G15).

Media: none. Release 1 ships no media (plan G15; Jeff, October 25, 2026). The Phase 0 probe
files (probe.mp4 and its four re-encodings, probe.png, probe.edds; all generated with ffmpeg
and DayZ Tools ImageToPAA, no third-party content) were deleted on October 26, 2026 at Phase 1
step (a). Their record is docs/testing/2026-10-25-greet-phase0.md.

